# Public front door for Marshall. Caddy fetches and renews a Let's Encrypt cert
# automatically once marshall.epetersons.com resolves to this host and 443 is
# reachable.
#
# The kneeboard charts are static and safe to serve openly. When the
# flight-planning app is added it MUST be behind auth before it is exposed here:
# it shells out to pydcs and deploys files, so an open endpoint is remote code
# execution. Add a matcher + basic_auth (or forward_auth) for those paths then.

marshall.epetersons.com {
	encode gzip
	reverse_proxy kneeboard:8362
}
